></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #880000;\"><strong>3. Назначение постоянной терапии бета-адреноблокаторами. - Неверно</strong></span></p><p>Бета-адреноблокаторы замедляют проведение через АВ-узел и могут быть опасны при ФП у пациентов с WPW. Источник: раздел 3.3.2, стр. 68 [1].</p>"}, "componentName": "ContentText"}, {"id": 3, "componentData": {"buttonsList": [{"image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "previous", "internalId": 0, "checkQuestion": false}, "buttonName": "Назад"}, {"image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "next", "internalId": 0, "checkQuestion": false, "closeSessionPick": true}, "buttonName": "Далее"}]}, "componentName": "ContentButtons"}]}, "internal_id": 44, "question_text": "", "created_by": "admin", "updated_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-06-06T10:22:01.590286Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-23T20:02:52.568351Z"}, {"id": 14882, "question_type_id": 2, "is_active": true, "test_id": 1197, "seq_no": 2, "body": {"name": "(0.5) Коридор", "content": [{"id": 1, "componentData": {"doors": [{"action": {"name": "moveToStep", "internalId": 2, "checkQuestion": false}, "points": [{"x": 14.562013278753994, "y": 23.094058852466347}, {"x": 18.9849366014377, "y": 26.761157819417736}, {"x": 19.024872703674124, "y": 94.59354456419659}, {"x": 14.522077176517573, "y": 100}], "blurLabel": false, "buttonName": "Кардиолог", "isComplete": false, "labelPoints": [{"x": 14.98951677316294, "y": 7.8970672414858205}, {"x": 30.550837150642145, "y": 7.8970672414858205}, {"x": 30.550837150642145, "y": 19.417747573328988}, {"x": 14.98951677316294, "y": 19.417747573328988}], "hideOnMobile": false, "mobilePoints": [{"x": 3.8721715173409286, "y": 40.8690642696868}, {"x": 10.334816753742103, "y": 42.86399802427252}, {"x": 10.105614138592756, "y": 71.94657655850327}, {"x": 3.804629581626834, "y": 75.02152054398148}], "hideDoorBlock": false, "mobileLabelPoints": [{"x": 4.640229516334349, "y": 34.018532999098355}, {"x": 26.676074299397477, "y"